===Noun===
{{en-noun|es|pl2=weirdos}}

#{{slang}} A strange, odd, eccentric person.
#{{slang}} An insane, possibly dangerous person.
#{{slang}} Any person who is behaving in a [[socially]] [[unacceptable]] [[fashion]] or [[manner]], at least as judged by a [[socially]] [[acceptable]] person.
#{{slang}} [[Oddly]] [[enough]](!), when [[uttered]] in [[reference]] to [[himself]], to [[herself]], or to [[anyone]] else by a person who considers the designation to be a badge of honor, as a [[high]] [[compliment]].  Examples:  "[[Yeah]], I'm a [[real]] [[weirdo]]," or "Yes, he's a [[little]] [[bit]] of a [[weirdo]]."
#{{slang}} [[Oddly]] [[enough]] [[also]](!), when [[uttered]] as part of a [[long]] [[string]] of [[adjectives]] and/or [[nouns]], is [[usually]] being [[spoken]] by a person who [[considers]] it to be a [[very]] [[positive]] [[thing]] to be [[thought]] of as [[being]] such a person.  Example:  "Yes, I am [[most]] [[definitely]] a [[long-haired]]-[[hippy]]-weirdo-[[freak]]!"

